title: HAP Q (HapY) 128x72
author: Amrit Rosell — procedural pattern dxvkit_plus_core::testpattern::tiles (carried over from Loombda-rs loombda_media::testpattern)
source: Minted in Loombda-rs (crates/loombda-media/examples/mint_fixtures.rs; reproducible here with scripts/mint-fixtures.sh) (128x72, 24 frames, 30 fps); encoded with glenc-cli 1.0.0 -c hapy (GlEnc, Amrit's encoder; AVFoundation / VideoToolbox for the native codecs)
